# KitchenSync REST API Examples
#
# Use this file with the VS Code REST Client extension (or raw http tooling)
# to execute and test the KitchenSync backend endpoints locally.
#

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### 1. Fetch Complete Restaurant State
# Returns all active tables, inventory, shifts, notifications, and orders.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/store/state
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Reset App State to Baseline Defaults
# Clears active orders, resets table statuses, and restores default stock levels.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/store/reset
Content-Type: application/json

{}

###

### 3. Seat Table 9 (Set to Occupied)
# Sets the status of Table 9 to "Occupied" and assigns it to waiter Marco Silva.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/tables/t-9
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Occupied",
  "assignedWaiterId": "u-wait-1"
}

###

### 4. Create and Submit a New Order
# Places a food order ticket for Table 9.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tableId": "t-9",
  "tableNumber": 9,
  "waiterId": "u-wait-1",
  "waiterName": "Marco Silva",
  "guestCount": 2,
  "customerName": "John Doe",
  "kitchenNotes": "Allergens: None. Dressing on the side please.",
  "items": [
    {
      "menuItemId": "m-3",
      "menuItemName": "Wagyu Beef Burger",
      "quantity": 2,
      "unitPrice": 26,
      "notes": "Medium rare"
    },
    {
      "menuItemId": "m-1",
      "menuItemName": "Truffle Parmesan Fries",
      "quantity": 1,
      "unitPrice": 14,
      "notes": "Extra crispy"
    }
  ]
}

###

### 5. Post Handover Shift Note
# Submits a kitchen note visible on the KDS system.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/shift-notes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "authorName": "Elena Rostova",
  "role": "waiter",
  "note": "We ran out of dessert spoons. Need to fetch clean ones from inventory.",
  "priority": "normal"
}

###

### 6. Trigger Low Stock Level for Truffle Oil
# Modifies stockQty for Truffle Oil (inv-2) below threshold to trigger alert.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/inventory/inv-2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stockQty": 1.1
}

###

### 7. Generate AI Operational Insights
# Triggers Gemini API model parsing for analytics forecasting.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/insights
Content-Type: application/json

{}

###

### 8. Generate AI Optimal Shift Staff Schedule
# Triggers Gemini API model optimization for staff scheduling shift recommendations.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/scheduler
Content-Type: application/json

{}
